European Commission Joint Research Centre. Iron and Steel Production, IS BREF, published January 2013; related BAT conclusions published March 2012. [Official reference and complete document](https://bureau-industrial-transformation.jrc.ec.europa.eu/reference/iron-and-steel-production) · [Institutional publication record](https://publications.jrc.ec.europa.eu/repository/handle/JRC69967).

Read the complete book for the sustained iron/steel case, including raw-material systems, coke, agglomeration, blast-furnace production, oxygen/electric steelmaking, secondary metallurgy, continuous casting, energy, water, residuals, observations, and technical alternatives. Derive representative balances from complete cases rather than using isolated consumption numbers with mismatched boundaries.

Official metadata, scope, dates, and full-document route checked on 29 October 2026; one direct portal request timed out. Separate the reference document from conclusions and actual current legal requirements. Preserve agency/component notices and historical operating context. All source material remains external.

